@ framework/player: every player model (code/player_models.cpp). Mods register
@ listeners (nsmbudx/player_models.h) instead of hooking these themselves.

@ PlayerModel::PlayerModel, 6 args (the 4th the forced mode). Entry: push {r4-r8, lr}.
PlayerModels_ctor:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0078C444
    symbol:     PlayerModels_ctor
    trampoline: PlayerModels_ctor_orig

@ PlayerModel::draw, called by every model class's draw. Entry: push {r4, lr}.
PlayerModels_draw:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x0078E574
    symbol:     PlayerModels_draw
    trampoline: PlayerModels_draw_orig
